      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems that this same issue can happen in game in some situations, so a portion of this bug report may be invalid (and devs just need to protect more against null objects and LocalPlayers).\n\nHowever, the UdonManager being recreated when accessed while play mode is exiting is still an issue that should be fixed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
